- Added a customizable end user agreement (EULA) for Windows. Admins can upload a markdown file of up to 512 KB in Settings > Integrations > MDM > End user license agreement, or set `windows_eula` in GitOps, and Fleet renders it as the terms page shown during Microsoft Entra and Autopilot enrollment. When no file is uploaded Fleet keeps showing its default terms. Adding or deleting an agreement on either platform now creates an activity.
